    "html": "<p>A stationary boat oscillates vertically on a river flowing at speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"u\"></span>, creating waves of frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span>. A raft floats along the river away from the boat at the same speed as the water. The speed of a wave on still water is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. What is the frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f'\"></span> of the waves created by the boat as seen by the raft?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\\frac{v}{v-u}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\\frac{v}{v+u}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\\frac{v-u}{v}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\\frac{v+u}v\"></span></p></li></ol>"
